From 3c5f122685de6d7792766e02de2d152034452974 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kuasar Sandbox <noreply@kuasar.dev>
Date: Fri, 17 Jul 2026 09:31:49 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] virtio-devices: reset vsock transport on restore

The Unix backend connection map is rebuilt empty on restore while the guest retains connected sockets. Publish VIRTIO_VSOCK_EVENT_TRANSPORT_RESET from the restored event queue before the vCPU resumes, and gate backend RX until the guest replenishes the event queue after handling the reset. This preserves the listener while reconciling the two transport endpoints before the first restore connection is delivered.
---
